! I would like to ask you to draw \"Stella\" from @_mpmbl's web novel \"Nothing Short of a Miracle Quest\"\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nxSurpHU4p-OVKi3cSfU3iVzfjC2GaLG?usp=sharing\nI would love to see a drawing where Stella is in a dim forest at sunset pushing aside a shrub, revealing this monster (https://files.catbox.moe/t13tyr.png) (https://files.catbox.moe/ji0yr6.png) ahead of her. Kind of like this image (https://skeb.jp/@ao2is/works/11).\nOtherwise, please draw as you like! Thank you!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amafuriyoru/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2577761, "client_id": 2924402, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6bd39eca/uploads/origins/e93bef03-818a-47d4-8934-5f21600613f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a20b21e61b07d3b2b8a59f50de23ea3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6bd39eca/uploads/origins/e93bef03-818a-47d4-8934-5f21600613f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a20b21e61b07d3b2b8a59f50de23ea3, https://si.imgix.net/6bd39eca/uploads/origins/e93bef03-818a-47d4-8934-5f21600613f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3077f01ce4acab3d11243e3f88f528b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6bd39eca/uploads/origins/e93bef03-818a-47d4-8934-5f21600613f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5650b55f92e1758455f41ffed3e09cc 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6bd39eca/uploads/origins/e93bef03-818a-47d4-8934-5f21600613f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a9796dc980f119eb2e3864c37b26b3d9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6bd39eca/uploads/origins/e93bef03-818a-47d4-8934-5f21600613f2