ED0B152t8LK1jgZIsqwkZo\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/3/folders/1RqBAvKvwVxED0B152t8LK1jgZIsqwkZo", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amafuriyoru/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2577761, "client_id": 3371456, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d53fb12e/uploads/origins/495bc708-8214-406b-a5f4-22a78f2cdeda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4dfe6cceabf4ff470e93fe82bf2687a0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d53fb12e/uploads/origins/495bc708-8214-406b-a5f4-22a78f2cdeda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4dfe6cceabf4ff470e93fe82bf2687a0, https://si.imgix.net/d53fb12e/uploads/origins/495bc708-8214-406b-a5f4-22a78f2cdeda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5af09dcb917bda23da7905c384767e7e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d53fb12e/uploads/origins/495bc708-8214-406b-a5f4-22a78f2cdeda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5bfe18a22feb636cac069f992f5a7f3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d53fb12e/uploads/origins/495bc708-8214-406b-a5f4-22a78f2cdeda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=20b3bf59c3a2e219bef30118526478f5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d53fb12e/uploads/origins/495bc708-8214-406b-a5f4-22a78f2cdeda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=20b3bf59c3a2e219bef30118526478f5, https://si.imgix.net/d53fb12e/uploads/origins/495bc708-8214-406b-a5f4-22a78f2cdeda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e2ce200c606a7f61ba2854f943b2464e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d53fb12e/uploads/origins/495bc708-8214-406b-a5f4-22a78f2cdeda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d322c235f70b09ecfbb8ee8980ca8f9a 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I have recently come across some of your artwork and positively adore your artstyle! \nI would love it if you could draw a vtuber that I enjoy by the name of Para. She is a blue haired bunny girl that loves eating raw meat and is a little crazy. For this piece, I would like it if you could draw her mischievously smiling at the camera beside a tree as autumn leaves fall around her. \nShe would be dressed in some sort of sweater and outfit suitable for autumn. \n\nThere are several important details that must be included:\n1. Her red eyes\n2. Several bandages around her ears\n3. She must be wearing glasses\n4. If mouth is open to any degree, teeth must be pointed.\n\nAll other design decisions would be at your discretion.\nThe link below is her art tag which should give you many samples to help visualize her. Her twitter @ is @wwparasiVT.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://x.com/search?q=%23parasiART&src=hashtag_click", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amafuriyoru/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2577761, "client_id": 960717, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4c9d551f/uploads/origins/1df2df4a-376c-411c-86d8-82af455f7792?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e229acea4f95fc8d37fb240288c3a80", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4c9d551f/uploads/origins/1df2df4a-376c-411c-86d8-82af455f7792?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e229acea4f95fc8d37fb240288c3a80, https://si.imgix.net/4c9d551f/uploads/origins/1df2df4a-376c-411c-86d8-82af455f7792?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97a5889899d2987d18036cc3d1a55248 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4c9d551f/uploads