webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4053fde52a0edb8d9073036c5360a24c 3x"}, "body": "I would like to request an illustration of \"a human sleeping peacefully in a room with numerous human arms.\"\n\nThe inspiration is a sea anemone and a clownfish. The concept is to personify the scene of a sea anemone and a clownfish, surrounded by disturbing predatory organs, standing peacefully without being harmed.\nThe contrast between the disturbing and the peaceful is the main focus of this work. There is no particular need to color the sleeping humans' clothing in the color of bears. We leave everything to you except for the two conditions of \"a room with many human arms\" and \"a person sleeping peacefully.\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amafuriyoru/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2577761, "client_id": 2760195, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42e1d79b/uploads/origins/d90720e8-e4ee-405b-96bd-a82cf514549f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69fa49224d9e5f7624b2f432164a485d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42e1d79b/uploads/origins/d90720e8-e4ee-405b-96bd-a82cf514549f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69fa49224d9e5f7624b2f432164a485d, https://si.imgix.net/42e1d79b/uploads/origins/d90720e8-e4ee-405b-96bd-a82cf514549f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e98243d8194c4a30c47ee978ef06d3f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/42e1d79b/uploads/origins/d90720e8-e4ee-405b-96bd-a82cf514549f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d34f52e35df2377ceb4cc3a6ccc406e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42e1d79b/uploads/origins/d90720e8-e4ee-405b-96bd-a82cf514549f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b5235ac84873d4ec8de8c007f41457ae", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42e1d79b/uploads/origins/d90720e8-e4ee-405b-96bd-a82cf514549f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b5235ac84873d4ec8de8c007f41457ae, https://si.imgix.net/42e1d79b/uploads/origins/d90720e8-e4ee-405b-96bd-a82cf514549f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=59004b25e7a146477a26da4c2a82003a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/42e1d79b/uploads/origins/d90720e8-e4ee-405b-96bd-a82cf514549f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cbf494ae4808b4fa5e4d0fc3dea915d2 3x"}, "body": "■Requests\n\nOriginal character illustration\n\n■Details\n\nDocument: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FJTNirqaEhbyoS7DZ-gUxnIqdmoiuiNJ?usp=drive_link\n\nPlease check the material at your discretion and draw freely.\nIf possible, we would like you to draw them as a set, but if it is difficult, please draw only Shiranui.\n\n■Usage\n\nCreation of goods for personal viewing.\nUse for social networking icons and headers with your name clearly written.\n\nIf there is any shortage in the amount, please resend.\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amafuriyoru/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2577761, "client_id": 3226357, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2888622a/uploads/origins/28487b93-ae50-4c55-ba1b-886f3462728d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54cb04de1b87607e8faec24b606b1fbe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2888622a/uploads/origins/28487b93-ae50-4c55-ba1b-886f3462728d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=