in the forest. She also likes sweets.\n\nI am happy to leave everything to you, including composition and facial expressions, so I would appreciate it if you could draw it as you like. I am sorry for your busy schedule, but I would appreciate your consideration!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amafuriyoru/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2577761, "client_id": 960717, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58979b55/uploads/origins/f1a50d2a-ffcf-4d6c-9117-b197faff4a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d83161b4e2dfa29300d84d11220441f9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58979b55/uploads/origins/f1a50d2a-ffcf-4d6c-9117-b197faff4a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d83161b4e2dfa29300d84d11220441f9, https://si.imgix.net/58979b55/uploads/origins/f1a50d2a-ffcf-4d6c-9117-b197faff4a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=706a8ab3d08d803714065514211486f3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58979b55/uploads/origins/f1a50d2a-ffcf-4d6c-9117-b197faff4a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19c83ab194eb46c6a4ff651a227a4310 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58979b55/uploads/origins/f1a50d2a-ffcf-4d6c-9117-b197faff4a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=95fb3c8508db81725d3ca2c21a11cd2a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58979b55/uploads/origins/f1a50d2a-ffcf-4d6c-9117-b197faff4a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=95fb3c8508db81725d3ca2c21a11cd2a, https://si.imgix.net/58979b55/uploads/origins/f1a50d2a-ffcf-4d6c-9117-b197faff4a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c3304e206b86341e74ed7eb7bb087b6f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58979b55/uploads/origins/f1a50d2a-ffcf-4d6c-9117-b197faff4a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=576c839f25d06716560bdb7d26f8b971 3x"}, "body": "雨降夜さん、こんにちは！   いつもイラストをTwitterで見ています、創作イラストも版権イラストもどちらも好きです！   解説のツイートも大好きです。\n\n良ければ私のオリジナルキャラクターを描いて頂きたいです。\n\nリクエスト内容\n◾︎創作キャラクターの「スターチス」を描いて頂きたいです。8歳の女の子です。\n両親に望まれて愛されて育った女の子ですが、8歳の誕生日に誘拐されて亡くなってしまった設定があります。\n母親が手作りしてくれた猫のぬいぐるみが大好きです！他はアイスクリームが好きです。\n\n資料1\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/92612144\n\n資料2\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/118587636\n\nお願いしたいこと\n◾︎可能であればPSD形式をお願いしたいです。\n◾︎もし良ければ手書きで「ゆんさん」(敬称はなくてもなんでもいいです)と、サインを書いて頂きたいです。\n◾︎服装は普段着で、暗い雰囲気で描いて頂けたら嬉しいです。\n\n使用用途\n◾︎SNS(Twitter(X)、Misskey、discord)等のアイコン、ヘッダー使用(使用する際はクレジットを記載します)\n◾︎スマホ、PCでの壁紙使用(こちら比率など気にしないで描いて頂いて大丈夫です)\n◾︎プリントして部屋に飾る\n\n以上となります。ご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amafuriyoru/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2577761, "client_id": 1373928, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/14816a89/uploads/origins/7020289e-7db7-4649-92fc-02996b4a049b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f0523732a4a2bfeb070bf7b7722bfc6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/14816a89/uploads/origins/7020289e-7db7-4649-92fc-02996b4a049b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f0523732a4a2bfeb070bf7b7722bfc6, https://si.imgix.net/14816a89/uploads/origins/7020289e-7db7-4649-92fc-02996b4a049b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91d9e049b9cc4fcdbfa0909540596420 2x, https://si.imgix.net/14816a89/uploads/origins/7020289e-7db7-4649-92fc-02996b4a049b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d91041a4ef0c031f7a540deb105127a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/14816a89/uploads/origins/7020289e-7db7-4649-92fc-02996b4a049b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6949adad95b12738fb7d0fbf7c347ec2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/14816a89/uploads/origins/7020289e-7db7-4649-92fc-02996b4a049b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6949adad95b12738fb7d0fbf7c347ec2, https://si.imgix.net/14816a89/uploads/origins/7020289e-7db7-4649-92fc-02996b4a049b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b390b277270d0da9f8c42a62ab7a63d5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/14816a89/uploads/origins/7020289e-7db7-4649-92fc-02996b4a049b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=30f5ffe6e3cb72778494d20d8d2b644c 3x"}, "body": "I saw \"Akari Akari Sheep\" by Ameya and liked it very much, so I would like to make a request.\n\nI would like you to draw Akari Kizoboshi as a deformed girl whose forearms have been transformed into dragon's jaws.\nThe dragon's jaw is black like a shadow, and the five eyes are yellow like the moon. The border between the forearm in the dragon's jaw and the upper arm in the human form can be clear or blurred.\nAkari is smiling and extending her arm as if to point the muzzle of a gun at an off-screen figure. The off-screen target is sitting down, probably begging for his life. Akari is probably thinking about dinner and is not paying attention to the target.\nThe background should be dark, like \"Akari Akari the Sheep\".\n\n(I have also prepared a reference image, but it was prepared by a person with no artistic ability, so it may be useless to even look at it. https://imgur.com/a/5Ypgush)", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amafuriyoru/works/1", "